00","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UNO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"535f87f1-01a8-4373-883c-eea5814258fb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"事前の仮定の検証、そしてその仮定の効力を正しく理解して発表すること、が大事だなあ","ts":"1631541562.091500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F00kr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c359e2b-5c7d-4ea7-8e31-a4901ffa5dcf","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u0026gt; 再現性については楽観的な結論も悲観的な結論も可能で、どちらもまだ正当化されていない\n\u0026gt; \nだったら最初から何も言えないのでは…という感じも","ts":"1631541510.090400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZMo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6abe23cc-0a23-4221-b9dc-940424b7aac2","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"件の論文は当然反論もあるようですが\n\u003chttps://www.google.com/amp/s/www.enago.jp/academy/reproducibility_psychology/|https://www.google.com/amp/s/www.enago.jp/academy/reproducibility_psychology/\u003e","ts":"1631541420.089400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"447D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6152a88e-95e1-48b4-b0df-d5e3fb5a86e4","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"試行回数うてない分野の信頼性を確保しづらいのは原理上しかたないとしても、だれも解決策を知らない","ts":"1631541394.088700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gky"}]},{"client_msg_id":"964e3bf5-5347-47ed-ac92-6cec4fd61c68","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"p\u0026lt;0.05ってこれだけの差しかないんですよね","ts":"1631541199.086500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bTD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79137d72-d0ae-4b0b-acf4-db2463adbcd0","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://camo.qiitausercontent.com/d9a8a78e01c3593004400fa3e62b0f26506cd942/68747470733a2f2f71696974612d696d6167652d73746f72652e73332e616d617a